  "name": "Confusion",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Creatures in a 10-ft-radius sphere (+5 ft per slot level above 4th) make a WIS save or are Confused: no Bonus Actions or Reactions, and a d10 at the start of each of their turns decides what they do (1 wander, 2-6 nothing, 7-8 attack a random creature in reach, 9-10 act normally). Repeat the save at the end of each of its turns.</p>",
